Comment: 0,0:00:34.43,0:00:36.97,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{Opening}
Comment: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:12.95,Ending,,0000,0000,0000,,{Ending}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.06,0:00:13.47,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:16.31,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Can you read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.16,0:00:22.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Light of the Fireflies...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.27,0:00:26.17,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.88,0:00:29.82,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Ooh, maybe Kobato can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.82,0:00:31.26,Default,Girls,0000,0000,0000,,Ehhh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.70,0:00:33.80,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, I can definitely read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:09.75,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,When night fell, the area became pitch black.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.75,0:02:14.10,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Tonight, it looks like even Mr. Moon is taking a night off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.50,0:02:17.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing could be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.99,0:02:20.49,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Spotted!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.11,0:02:25.01,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, you skipped a page again!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.01,0:02:28.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.22,0:02:33.12,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You're always such a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.82,0:02:38.26,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,You can do it, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.74,0:02:39.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.25,0:02:43.64,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She messed up again, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.57,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, this is Yomogi Nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.41,0:02:59.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm pretty sure I've already refused that offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:05.02,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, but I'm currently in the middle of work. You'll have to excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.44,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato fell again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.09,Default,Children,0000,0000,0000,,She knocked something over again!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.22,0:03:23.74,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato! Whaddaya think you're doing right now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.91,0:03:27.10,Default,Child,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.10,0:03:28.82,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bye bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.62,0:03:31.72,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.72,0:03:33.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it Marina?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.48,0:03:36.83,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,It'd be nice if you could actually read the picture book!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:38.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'll try my best...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.25,0:03:43.01,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, I'm sure you'll be able to soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.01,0:03:44.12,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.76,0:04:00.67,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.85,0:04:05.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to practice reading out loud so that it pleases everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.77,0:04:07.51,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,May I please borrow this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.75,0:04:11.34,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Um sure, I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:13.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best so I can read better!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.77,0:04:16.27,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.67,0:04:17.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:26.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That firefly lived by himself for a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:32.37,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And so, he came to forget the fact that he was a firefly at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.60,0:04:36.38,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It's lonely to be all by yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.77,0:04:37.80,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.13,0:04:45.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,On one of those dark days, the firefly felt that something good had happened...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.45,0:04:46.21,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.27,0:04:51.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something that I could do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.69,0:04:54.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Could you stop reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.43,0:04:55.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:58.65,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I said, stop reading that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.65,0:05:01.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, is there a reason why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.46,0:05:05.70,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.20,0:05:10.48,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:12.39,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's the guy from earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.84,0:05:18.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,It is, isn't it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.04,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.79,0:05:22.11,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He seems completely different than he was earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.12,0:05:25.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if something's troubling him...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.75,0:05:35.06,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you not have a house?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.06,0:05:36.31,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,How did you come up with that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.31,0:05:40.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, I was also living in the park until just a little while ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.64,0:05:45.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks to Miss Sayaka and Miss Chitose, I have fluffy bedsheets to sleep on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.78,0:05:48.11,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Bedsheets are so nice!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:52.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you'd like to, you could stay at my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.08,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I don't need help from someone I don't even know!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.08,0:05:59.96,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kobato Hanato! This is Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:09.06,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have no desire to associate with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:12.64,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.33,0:06:17.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder why he got so angry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.56,0:06:25.32,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly saw a small, beautiful light in the distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.59,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wondering what it was, he moved closer to it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.37,0:06:35.56,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I just can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.46,0:06:45.72,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my best tomorrow too!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:53.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I overslept again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.18,0:06:56.18,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You're just slow at everything, aren't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.18,0:06:59.53,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,If you're late, Fujimoto will yell at you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.29,0:07:04.40,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,She's fast...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.42,0:07:16.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.61,0:07:19.47,Default,Punk 1,0000,0000,0000,,What's a matter, girlie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.47,0:07:21.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.86,0:07:23.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.99,0:07:28.51,Default,Punk 2,0000,0000,0000,,We came to get our money back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.36,0:07:30.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Money?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.41,0:07:33.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,They look dangerous...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.89,0:07:36.05,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,I said eat it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.05,0:07:38.47,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,I just love kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.76,0:07:40.46,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.52,0:07:43.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.85,0:07:45.77,Default,Punk 1,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.94,0:07:55.20,Default,Punk 1,0000,0000,0000,,Didn't even apologize for bumping into me, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.75,Default,Punk 1,0000,0000,0000,,What the hell are you doing?! Let go of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:09.82,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you dare touch the kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.59,0:08:12.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.13,0:08:13.68,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.32,0:08:17.33,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,Owww!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.75,0:08:20.54,Default,Punk 2,0000,0000,0000,,Looking down on us...?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.54,0:08:21.64,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.84,0:08:26.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.58,0:08:31.85,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I believe I've asked you not to come to this place during school hours anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.85,0:08:34.43,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,Who do you think you are, giving orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.43,0:08:38.55,Default,Punk 2,0000,0000,0000,,The one at fault is the one who can't pay back her loans, isn't it teach?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.28,0:08:44.16,Default,Punk 2,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get so conceited just 'cause our boss is being easy on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.60,0:08:48.68,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'll deal with you guys after the nursery closes, so--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.68,0:08:52.06,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,Y'know, if you just returned what you owed us, we'd leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.06,0:08:56.31,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,Which is why I'm telling you to just hurry the hell up and pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.89,0:08:59.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You--!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.23,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That girl...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.77,0:09:16.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,P-Please leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.27,0:09:21.49,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,K-Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.97,0:09:23.25,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:27.17,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time to play with children!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.05,0:09:31.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.89,0:09:35.93,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,What's with this girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.93,0:09:42.96,Default,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,Police! Help! There are scary people here! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.96,0:09:46.10,Default,Punk 3,0000,0000,0000,,We'll call it a day, but you're not\Ngetting rid of us until you pay up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.10,0:09:47.90,Default,Punk 1,0000,0000,0000,,Let go, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.90,0:09:55.47,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all right Miss Sayaka?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.59,0:10:02.49,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.06,0:10:07.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko! Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.15,0:10:12.06,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I was faking it, I'm fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.90,0:10:16.20,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,I thought they'd leave if I called for the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.20,0:10:18.14,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.14,0:10:20.29,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They really did leave after that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.29,0:10:21.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Well done!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.35,0:10:24.26,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko's amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.26,0:10:28.60,Default,Toshihiko,0000,0000,0000,,Nah... If they come again, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.19,0:10:34.44,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Dobato did well, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.86,0:10:38.36,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But how long do I have to lay here like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.09,0:10:59.19,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So yesterday's call was from them, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.79,0:11:03.24,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss Sayaka's having difficulties...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:06.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if there's anything I could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:07.89,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You have no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.29,0:11:14.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But if I could pay back her loan, I could help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.79,0:11:20.78,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.87,0:11:22.81,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.05,0:11:32.55,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you an idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.88,0:11:41.09,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.50,0:11:43.29,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,He's still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.29,0:11:44.60,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.97,0:11:50.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,He's... No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.48,0:11:52.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.27,0:11:57.90,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Do you feel sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.93,0:12:00.60,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.67,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.67,0:12:06.13,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything I could do to help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.13,0:12:08.45,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If there's anything wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.87,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,There's nothing wrong, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.87,0:12:13.36,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have a place to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.36,0:12:15.75,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I just like being here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:17.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.07,0:12:21.51,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,The book from yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.51,0:12:25.40,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, I borrowed it from the nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:29.39,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I've been practicing, but it just seems like I can't get the hang of reading out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.39,0:12:31.43,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I thought I told you not to read it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.43,0:12:33.30,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:36.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone really likes this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I really want to be able to read it for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.36,0:12:40.32,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm begging you, so don't read it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:50.37,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Nothing. Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.53,0:12:57.91,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Does he really hate this book that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.31,0:13:09.69,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Why are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.47,0:13:12.05,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,'Cause I live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.05,0:13:13.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,We're neighbors?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.66,0:13:15.94,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Well duh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.54,0:13:19.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.79,0:13:21.31,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.31,0:13:25.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was told not to read this book anymore by a man in the park...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.74,0:13:28.64,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,You met Mr. Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:29.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Mr. Mori?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.98,0:13:34.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Is there something the matter with Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:36.71,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,No. He's the person who wrote the book!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.95,0:13:38.01,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.55,0:13:41.71,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?! Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.71,0:13:44.19,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,He's sort of famous around this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.19,0:13:48.74,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,But then, why did he say not to read this book?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:49.66,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.78,0:13:56.10,Default,Fujimoto,0000,0000,0000,,That was supposedly the last book he wrote.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.14,0:14:00.61,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,His... last book.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.43,0:14:10.62,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,On the bank of a beautiful\Nstream lived a single firefly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.53,0:14:16.79,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That firefly lived by himself for a long, long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:21.00,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And so, he came to forget the fact that he was a firefly at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.14,0:14:30.18,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,One moonless, pitch black night, that firefly saw a small, beautiful light.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:35.83,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Wondering what it was, he approached it, and found that it was a female bug.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.42,0:14:41.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,"You're so pretty. What sort of bug are you?" He asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.85,0:14:46.58,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,"A firefly, the same as you," she replied.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.58,0:14:51.31,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And then she asked him, "Why don't you glow?"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.31,0:14:57.76,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly who had been alone for so long had forgotten how to glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.19,0:15:05.26,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,And so, she taught the sad firefly how to glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.38,0:15:13.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,In the end, by the banks of the stream, the two of them lived and glowed - together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.08,0:15:20.77,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,So that old man's forgotten how to glow too, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.41,0:15:24.96,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not sure why, but he's like that firefly in the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.90,0:15:28.85,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't there anything I can do for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.24,0:15:39.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.97,0:15:41.35,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.18,0:15:47.16,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.47,0:15:54.55,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Are you doing anything tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:04.81,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go see the fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.25,0:16:07.77,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting at the Hachiman Mountain riverside!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.91,0:16:20.19,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,The firefly remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.19,0:16:25.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a firefly too! And I can glow, just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.04,0:16:28.10,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You've gotten good at reading that, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.10,0:16:31.21,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure he'll be able to\Nremember how to glow again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.21,0:16:34.48,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But he's still not here, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.61,0:16:38.52,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,You came!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.17,0:16:41.89,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I guess I had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.89,0:16:45.98,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Um, the fireflies haven't come out yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.60,0:16:49.12,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why did you say that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.38,0:16:54.32,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,"Let's go see the fireflies. I'll be waiting at the Hachiman Mountain riverside."
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.34,0:16:57.56,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The same thing as Naoko...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.13,0:16:59.95,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Miss... Naoko?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.19,0:17:03.69,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,My... ex-girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:08.75,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The pictures... Naoko drew those pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.75,0:17:13.20,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She said a story about fireflies would be nice, so I went ahead and wrote the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.20,0:17:15.18,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She filled in the pictures afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.67,0:17:18.73,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go see the fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:23.35,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I said let's go see the fireflies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.74,0:17:25.84,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,You promised, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:26.06,Default Alt,Mori (on the phone),0000,0000,0000,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:28.30,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I don't have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.30,0:17:30.86,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that. I found just the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.83,0:17:33.61,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I said, I don't have time--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.53,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be waiting by the Hachiman Mountain riverside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.38,0:17:43.05,Default,Mori (on the phone),0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.05,0:17:46.04,Default,Mori (narrating),0000,0000,0000,,In the end, I didn't go. Back then, I was so busy, had so many deadlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.20,0:17:45.09,Default Alt,Mori (on the phone),0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:52.08,Default,Mori (narrating),0000,0000,0000,,Back then, I was so busy, had so many deadlines...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.08,0:17:54.36,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,So your girlfriend went by herself...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.89,0:18:00.88,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,It was very beautiful, I wanted to show it to you too, she said.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.97,0:18:09.33,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,There was something sad about the pictures that Naoko drew, but they were beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.33,0:18:13.84,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,That's why I also changed the story to be a beautiful, but sad one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.84,0:18:17.89,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,It was a while after the book was published...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.44,0:18:20.44,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,You were finally able to get a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.44,0:18:22.87,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I'll be waiting at our usual spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.76,0:18:40.55,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko! Naoko! Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.73,0:18:43.92,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Sotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.92,0:18:45.10,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.62,0:18:48.59,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything you want? I'll bring you anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:51.47,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:56.91,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to... see the fireflies with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.76,0:19:07.70,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't I just go with her back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:10.67,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,She wanted to see them so badly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.51,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Why didn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.48,0:19:14.34,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,...I?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.21,0:19:22.20,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.22,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.78,0:19:29.23,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,If you wait just a little longer, I'm sure--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.13,0:19:40.22,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:42.03,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.58,0:19:53.68,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.85,0:20:06.13,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Naoko... stood here and drew this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.45,0:20:11.31,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Right here...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.46,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Fireflies...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.76,0:20:49.20,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,What? You've never seen fireflies before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.20,0:20:51.19,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,What, is there something wrong with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.19,0:20:53.35,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's go see them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.35,0:20:55.27,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,You can't write a story about something if you don't see the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.86,0:20:58.48,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,There aren't any fireflies in this area, are there?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.18,0:21:00.99,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I'll definitely find a place for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.99,0:21:02.15,Default,Naoko,0000,0000,0000,,I promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.36,0:21:15.96,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Promise, huh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.65,0:21:29.10,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,The fireflies are pretty, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.73,0:21:44.68,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,They're really... beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.51,0:21:47.46,Default,Mori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.41,0:21:56.97,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That old man remembered how to glow again, huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I bet he'll start writing again.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.69,0:22:10.43,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this, it proves it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.63,0:22:12.93,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,There are more of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.99,0:22:15.50,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Which means!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:18.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,That old man was healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:23.15,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,I was able to help Mr. Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.77,0:22:28.61,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd like to be able to say 100 points this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.85,0:22:32.08,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,but after subtracting points for crushing me in the library...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.65,0:22:36.63,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,80 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.82,0:22:40.07,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.07,0:22:42.42,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,You better keep up your pace!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:45.41,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes! I'll do my best!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.92,0:22:51.21,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,But I'm just too nice giving out 80 points like that. Perhaps I should lower it to 50...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.21,0:22:54.04,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,No, 80 points is good!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.04,0:22:55.82,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,Well then...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:55.82,Default Alt,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.82,0:22:57.38,Default,Ioryogi,0000,0000,0000,,79 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.38,0:22:59.60,Default,Kobato,0000,0000,0000,,That's cheating!
