Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:44.97,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}How do I do this again?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:49.56,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}The simplest things in life
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:53.57,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}end up being the most difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.80,0:00:56.37,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I just want to smile when I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.64,0:01:03.71,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and sing a song whenever I please.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.13,0:01:09.29,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I was told, "Someday, your dream will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.08,0:01:13.13,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}But when exactly will that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.30,0:01:16.67,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I can't wait that long!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.92,0:01:19.73,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.87,0:01:22.47,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}on the count of one two three
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.72,0:01:27.72,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}and gather all the light in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.90,0:01:30.53,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.54,0:01:34.12,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}isn't there something I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:36.88,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if someone hurts my feelings,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.95,0:01:39.62,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I'll keep running toward the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.85,0:01:46.50,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Even if I trip, fall, and cry my eyes out, I still believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:50.51,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}Although it may seem silly...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:55.16,Opening,TL,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(100,100)}{be1\blur3}I believe in tomorrow.
